@startuml US072_SSD
title US072 - List Company Fleet - SSD

actor "Air Transport Company Collaborator" as Collab
participant "SEM4PI System" as System

Collab -> System : request to list company fleet
System --> Collab : prompt to select sorting option (Registration, Maker, Model, Capacity, Age)

Collab -> System : select sorting option
System --> Collab : present sorted list of aircraft (Registration, Maker, Model, Capacity, Age, Status)

alt no collaborator profile found
    System --> Collab : show error (No collaborator profile found for the current user)
else no registered aircraft
    System --> Collab : present empty fleet message
end

@enduml